</div>

<div class="modal template-code-modal" id="templateCodeModal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-card template-code-modal__card"><header class="template-code-modal__head"><div><strong id="templateModalTitle">Proforma Şablonu</strong><small>Değişiklikler sağdaki gerçek proforma motorunda anlık görünür.</small></div><div class="template-code-modal__head-actions"><button class="btn btn--sm" type="button" data-template-fullscreen aria-pressed="false">⛶ Tam Ekran</button><button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-template-modal-close aria-label="Kapat">×</button></div></header><form id="templateCodeForm" method="post" action="/templates/create"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%=csrfToken%>"><input type="hidden" name="template_id" id="tplTemplateId" value="">
